{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36143","headline":"与清溪赵明府 · 方干","name":"与清溪赵明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清规暂趋府，独立与谁亲。\n遂性无非酒，求闲却爱贫。\n林泉应入梦，印绶莫留人。\n王事闻多暇，吟来几首新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}